  "widget_code": "<h2 class=\"sr-only\">Timeline from 1920 to 2026 of 46 Rijksmuseum works displaced 1933 to 1945, showing owners, wartime seizures and sales, recuperation, restitution and gaps in the provenance record.</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0 0 10px\">\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#888780\"></span>private owner or dealer</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#eb6834\"></span>German or Nazi custody</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#eda100\"></span>state custody after recovery</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#2a78d6;opacity:.4\"></span>on loan to museum</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#1baf7a\"></span>restituted owner or heirs</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;height:8px;border-radius:2px;background:#2a78d6\"></span>museum owns</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px\"><span style=\"width:14px;border-top:2px dotted #888780\"></span>gap in record</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0 0 8px\">\n<span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"10\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px\"><path d=\"M1 1H11L6 9Z\" fill=\"#a32d2d\"/></svg> confiscation or forced sale</span>\n<span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"10\" style=\"vertical-align:-1px\"><path d=\"M1 1H11L6 9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a32d2d\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg> sale to German buyer</span>\n<span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"1